{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222210","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222210","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322221001:1":{"text":"페인트를 가져 오셨습니까? 감사합니다!","source_cn":"你们把涂料带来了？十分感谢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26CDDAC8E302420A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322221002:1":{"text":"음... 이 나무의 향기, 부드러운 오일... 바로 제가 찾던 것입니다!","source_cn":"嗯……这果木的清香，顺滑的油脂，正是我所需要的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1B825F826413811","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322221003:1":{"text":"이제 이걸로 액자가 부식되는 것을 막을 수 있겠군요. 도와주셔서 다시 한 번 감사드립니다.","source_cn":"这样就可以延缓木框的腐朽了，再次感谢各位的帮助。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD00252F41E3910A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:管家瓦茨拉夫":{"text":"집사 바츨라프","source":"管家瓦茨拉夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}